    step('Design the security-group chain', 'Let the ALB security group accept HTTPS; let the application group accept its application port only from the ALB group; let the database group accept its database port only from the application group. Do not launch servers.', 'No rule opens the database to 0.0.0.0/0.'),
    step('Walk through failures', 'Remove the IGW route, application inbound rule, and NACL return rule from the diagram one at a time. Predict symptoms and identify repairs. Describe the surviving path after one AZ fails.', 'Each of the four cases has a clear break point and troubleshooting order.'),
    step('Remove the skeleton', 'If resources were created, delete custom security groups, subnets, and nondefault route tables, detach and delete the IGW, then delete the dedicated VPC.', 'Only this lab’s resources are removed; existing default VPCs remain untouched.')
