    step('Run a bounded log query', 'In Logs Insights, select only this log group and a short recent window. Query: fields @timestamp, @message | filter @message like /intentional-lab-failure/ | sort @timestamp desc | limit 20.', 'The query returns only the intended failures, and the scanned volume is reviewed.'),
    step('Design an alarm and response', 'You may keep this as a local draft: define an error count/rate threshold, evaluation window, missing-data behavior, owner, and response steps. If creating an actual alarm, scope it to this function and use your own notification channel.', 'Every alarm specifies an action rather than just saying notify.'),
    step('Clean up and summarize', 'Delete any alarms, function, log group, and dedicated role created here. Explain whether CloudTrail could replace the application logs used in this investigation and why.', 'Every resource created for this lab has a recorded cleanup status.')
